    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adidaahaadi ghwaroat heeyda orjeeda geamadu ghana gisilleandaanyi, ak ea muweadi saawa; aghuumda gabiikta heeda orjeeda geamadu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ea mii neekeeweey, ghana iideepa ea minali, gajadeelni ea ghwahidu gheang'u, ak gaygoobiida headaang'u ea ghwanyas orjeeda geamadu; abeeda gajadeelsiina niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaysindunu eara aba digeadaanyi; ak gaysindunu eara aba hang'weakaaschi, ak gaysindunu eara aba gida wassean roat bea orjeeda geamadu, ghayi huta ak ginyasi; adiidu gishoami weataang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gidaahi digeeda orjeeda geamadu ghana heeydaanyi nea goobeedeaysa ghuuta naweeda, ak gishoami weataang'u; weada niny ak gigatkadi ghamiinaada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gatmooda adagooshuup geaw gida wassean haguuw ng'eedeeda, ghana gooshuup geaw ng'eedeeda hang'da gatmooda; aba gideaba siida wassean sina ng'asheesu eamuy aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iinyasi gheata naweeda ghooriida darideanda, aba uhuuda geeta wassean ghana ng'eanyi, nea gwandeawa dayeega manang'i ghana ea burunga nea ghabwat gheamata dayeega ghana ea burunga, adigeandi gheamata sea dayeega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaynung'waada gawa gheamata, nea dayeega giimuusi geanda ghoah gaagu; ak abeeda ghoah gheamamdaang'u, ak abeeda giibiidi ng'eanyiida ea gageawiit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iideasi gheedeesh, gisisi uhuudeaba gheang'u gireayda, ak ea miyeani riing'eeda foojeanda badaydeaba gheang'u, iideepa ghang'adaana siida wassean uhuuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adihisi madamnyeandaang'u bea sabiibu heeluut iyeenya bea histeanga, ak abeeda ea meehisiina histeanga sean heeda ghaydit, histeanga ihisti sea gichih madamnyeanda sabiibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu gibwardi duwaawi deeda ea digeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiidu giikweali hang'da mawuurji gulbeenga, was buudeega gisilga ea gulbeenga bumbuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adisissi geaw seapseapta aba murdajeega asang'wan bea hang'daang'u was dea iikwealayi ang'iing'i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita deaweedajeega luudayeeda hit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iigheah gatmooda, ak gwaluudayi, amang'ata ghwasit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoahaakta ak gwarukuna badayda ng'asheega munyas nea goomunyiit gheawunga nea gwayi, ‘Ghaagheanyi gatmooni, ama muchu nea geawi heeda, ea meadeaksiini gidahiimu gideaba miyeasat,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda ghweanda gatmooda duu ea mwanang' sea ghaamwat gaygooruudu jarooda gwadeagooda gideaba miyeasat ak goohiimsa gweargwa mujiini mida dooshta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwayeesha ghweanda gatmooda gweargwa, ‘Aniini ghaadawji hudeanyu siisi ghoah gatmoadaanyi, ak ghwasit; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uuw, nirukuna badayda ng'asheega munyas bea baspaseega nea gwayi, “Aniini miidadeaksa hudaang'u gwadeagooda gideaba miyeasat.” Ak suh ea gwadeagooda hudeanyu gil ahiimu gideaba miyeesadi.’ Ak gajeayaaw hang'da aba madeeda gweargwa mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghwaat gweargwa mujiini siidida ak ghabwar; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gajeayaaga ghoorjooda shiliingaji bughala, ak geataw ghweanda gatmooda, aba gideaba nimunyiit gheawunga huda miyeasat bea Israeli; ak gayghoah gatmoadaanyi; ak ea maygwaheeli gatmooda aba jeeda eawoojigaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadeepa ng'asheanda ea huumwa gil, gideaba manda gwadeagooda sideaksa gatmooda mwanang', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gaygooruudu gatmooda jarooda madeeda dooshta ghwaan, ak gafuta fuga mujiineeda nyaawa lagheanga ea ghami, aba gideaba gwasin leendeeda aba jeeda Israeli aba gideaba gwahiseada aba gheeh ghwaan; abeeda gaygeandeawana munyinda jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea siida iisinyas nea gwaluudayi sea gatmoomba siinuut, gaygameewa duwaawi, siida luudayi gatmooda, sea gatmooda; abeeda gaygeanda munyinda aba jeeda Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea iimida huda siinyeari nea miyeasat, ak gwaroonyi siida sea niny aba jeeda mujiini ak gwaluudayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda gajayeani duwaawi ghuuta mujiini, ak gajafuta duwaawi aba lagheanga ea gameewa, aba gideaba gatmooda meaguula gagasa weeta nea gwanda jeeda mujiini, nea ng'eedeeda gweagu gideaba ghabwasay gatmooda giischeewoocheandaanyi; abeeda gaygeandeawana munyinda jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
