        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda siida luudayi sea gatmooda gayghoadaw ghweanda gatmooda shiliingaji haradam ea damanamughuush, ak gayghoah gatmoadaanyi, aba gideaba nibwaay; maygwanung'usa heeda aba jeeda askwearjoojigaaschi sean.",
